<!--META-DATA
{
	tags: for, logical,
}
-->

<statement>
<p>
	Write a function <pf>display_game_board</pf>.
</p>

<tabular valign="top" top="minor">
	<col width="12%"/>
	<col width="88%"/>
	<row bottom="minor">
		<cell>Inputs:</cell>
		<cell>
			<p><pf>guess_boxes</pf> (6 5 struct with 4 fields) number — --described in detail above</p>
			<p><pf>keyboard</pf> (struct) number — is a structure containing 26 fields (one for each letter); each of the letters contains a struct with three fields--described in detail previously</p>
			<p><pf>initialize</pf> (1x1 logical) logical — if this value is <pf>true</pf> then it should: (1) define the initial figure and (2) plot the guess boxes and keyboard. If <pf>false</pf>, it should only plot the guess boxes and keyboard.</p>
		</cell>
	</row>
	<row bottom="minor">
		<cell>Outputs:</cell>
		<cell>
			<p><pf>no</pf> number — function outputs, but the game board is displayed</p>
		</cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell>Details:</cell>
		<cell><p>Note that the keyboard should be drawn using only</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>fill</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>commands. No</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>plot</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>commands are needed.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>When initializing only, you can use the</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>close all</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>command to clear any game boards still open from from previous games.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Use the information stored in the input structures to create the game board.</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>Don't forget to check the value of</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>initialize</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>to see if the figure should be defined for the first time. If</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>initialize</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>is</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row>
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>false</p></cell>
	</row>
	<row bottom="minor">
		<cell/>
		<cell><p>then this part should be skipped.</p></cell>
	</row>
</tabular>

<p>
	Examples:
<program>
	<code>
		Load
		this .mat
		file to get the sample inputs.
		INPUTS
		guess_boxes1
		keyboard1
		initialize1
		OUTPUT
		INPUTS
		guess_boxes2
		keyboard2
		initialize2
		OUTPUT
		INPUTS
		guess_boxes3
		keyboard3
		initialize3
		OUTPUT
		INPUTS
		guess_boxes4
		keyboard4
		initialize4
		OUTPUT
		INPUTS
		guess_boxes5
		keyboard5
		initialize5
		OUTPUT
	</code>
</program>
</p>
</statement>
